# Title: Cmd Launched with Hidden Start Flags to Suspicious Targets
# ID: 5a6b7c8d-9e0f-1a2b-3c4d-5e6f7a8b9c0d
# Status: experimental
# Level: medium
# Author: Vladan Sekulic, Swachchhanda Shrawan Poudel (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2026-01-24
# Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1564.003
# Description: Detects cmd.exe executing commands with the "start" utility using "/b" (no window) or "/min" (minimized) flags.
# To reduce false positives from standard background tasks, detection is restricted to scenarios where the target is a known script extension or located in suspicious temporary/public directories.
# This technique was observed in Chaos, DarkSide, and Emotet malware campaigns.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((((cmdline:*start * OR cmdline:*start/b* OR cmdline:*start/min*)) AND ((cmdline:*/b * OR cmdline:*-b * OR cmdline:*/b\"* OR cmdline:*-b\"* OR cmdline:*/min * OR cmdline:*-min * OR cmdline:*/min\"* OR cmdline:*-min\"*)) AND ((process_name:*\\cmd.exe) OR (OriginalFileName:"Cmd.Exe"))) AND (((cmdline:*.bat* OR cmdline:*.cmd* OR cmdline:*.cpl* OR cmdline:*.hta* OR cmdline:*.js* OR cmdline:*.ps1* OR cmdline:*.scr* OR cmdline:*.vbe* OR cmdline:*.vbs*)) OR ((cmdline:* -nop * OR cmdline:* -sta * OR cmdline:*.downloadfile(* OR cmdline:*.downloadstring(* OR cmdline:*-noni * OR cmdline:*-w hidden *)) OR ((cmdline:*:\\Perflogs\\* OR cmdline:*:\\Temp\\* OR cmdline:*:\\Users\\Default\\* OR cmdline:*:\\Windows\\Temp\\* OR cmdline:*\\AppData\\Roaming\\* OR cmdline:*\\Contacts\\* OR cmdline:*\\Documents\\* OR cmdline:*\\Downloads\\* OR cmdline:*\\Favorites\\* OR cmdline:*\\Favourites\\* OR cmdline:*\\inetpub\\* OR cmdline:*\\Music\\* OR cmdline:*\\Photos\\* OR cmdline:*\\Temporary Internet\\* OR cmdline:*\\Users\\Public\\* OR cmdline:*\\Videos\\*))))
